2. **`index.css`**:
   - Added `.entry-inline-link` styles with gold underline, offset, and hover glow.
   - Added `.entry-links-section`, `.entry-links-heading`, `.entry-links-grid`, and `.entry-link-chip` styles matching the "Lacquer & Leaf" theme with hover lift and smooth micro-animations.
